            "value": "正在添加风格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds the Photographic Styles palette to HEIC photos, or Texture & Grain to photos that already have a style. Live Photos found in the library keep their motion when saved to Photos.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adds the Photographic Styles palette to HEIC photos, or Texture & Grain to photos that already have a style. Live Photos found in the library keep their motion when saved to Photos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为 HEIC 照片添加摄影风格色板，或为已有风格的照片添加质感与颗粒。图库中的实况照片存入“照片”时会保留动态效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds the iOS 27 Texture and Grain controls, and Soft Skin for portraits with face data. Photos from iPhone 16 and 17 that already have a style get just these.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adds the iOS 27 Texture and Grain controls, and Soft Skin for portraits with face data. Photos from iPhone 16 and 17 that already have a style get just these."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加 iOS 27 的质感与颗粒控制项，并为带人脸数据的人像添加“柔肤”。iPhone 16 和 17 拍摄的、已有风格的照片只会添加这些。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds the style palette introduced with iPhone 16 to HEIC photos from earlier iPhones, so you can change the style in Photos and change it back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adds the style palette introduced with iPhone 16 to HEIC photos from earlier iPhones, so you can change the style in Photos and change it back."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为早期 iPhone 拍摄的 HEIC 照片加上 iPhone 16 引入的风格色板，让你可以在“照片”中更改风格，也可以改回去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
