    "Live Photos keep their motion when their video can be styled. Cropped videos are re-encoded to prevent blurred edges. If video processing fails, the job explains why a still was saved; the original keeps its motion.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live Photos keep their motion when their video can be styled. Cropped videos are re-encoded to prevent blurred edges. If video processing fails, the job explains why a still was saved; the original keeps its motion."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当视频可以加风格时，实况照片会保留动态效果。裁剪过的视频会重新编码，以避免边缘模糊。如果视频处理失败，任务会说明为何只保存了静态照片；原图仍保留其动态效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
