            "value": "“添加摄影风格”操作始终保存为新照片，绝不会替换原图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Backup Bin lives in the app's own storage on this device and is deleted with the app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Backup Bin lives in the app's own storage on this device and is deleted with the app."
          }
