    "The styled photo is saved next to the original as a new photo, named with \"_PhotographicStyle\".": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The styled photo is saved next to the original as a new photo, named with \"_PhotographicStyle\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "风格版会作为新照片保存在原图旁，文件名带有“_PhotographicStyle”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The styled photo takes the original's place, with its date, location, favorite and albums. The original goes to the Backup Bin, so you can restore it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The styled photo takes the original's place, with its date, location, favorite and albums. The original goes to the Backup Bin, so you can restore it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "风格版会取代原图，并保留其日期、位置、收藏状态和相簿。原图会放入备份箱，你可以随时恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They can't be restored afterwards, except from Recently Deleted in Photos for up to 30 days after they were replaced.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "They can't be restored afterwards, except from Recently Deleted in Photos for up to 30 days after they were replaced."
